# Database

- Canonical concepts: see `brain/architecture/canonical-model.md` — implement tables incrementally per milestone.
- Migrations are forward-only, reviewable, and aligned with provenance (claims ↔ evidence chips).
- Questions, answers, and user intent are **first-class versioned** data.
- Production cases may emit **Domain Learning Candidates**; they do not silently mutate pack knowledge.

See `brain/architecture/provenance.md`, ADR-002, ADR-005.
